  {
    "id": "76635",
    "original": "そのため、僕にとってのココは「遊び相手のお姉さん」で、家族のひとりとしての認識しかなく、親父に誰何するような存在ではなかった。",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "327085",
        "text": "For that reason Coco was, to me, 'an older sister I can play with' and I thought of her only as one member of the family not as someone I should question my father concerning her identity."
      }
